<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">3 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A ham loh thintlo Kaiyu te ka yaak sak. Anih he kai loh oltak neh ka lungnah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thintlo aw, na hinglu loh a hoeikhang vanbangla, a cungkuem dongah nang hoeikhang sak ham neh sading sak ham ka thangthui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Oltak dongah na pongthoh vanbangla, manuca aka pawk rhoek loh oltak ah na om te khaw a phong uh dongah bahoeng ka omngaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ca rhoek te oltak dongah pongpa uh tila ka yaak vaengah, hekah lakah a lenngai omngaihnah ka khueh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thintlo aw, manuca rhoek neh olpuei la yinlai rhoek ham na saii te khaw uepom la saii.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amih loh hlangboel hmaiah nang kah lungnah a phong uh. Pathen neh a tingtawk la amih thak ham te a then la saii.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Boeipa ming ham cet uh dae namtom rhoek taengkah a bawn uh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mamih loh tebang te doo ham a kuek tangloeng. Te daengah ni oltak dongah bibipuei la n'om uh eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hlangboel ham bet ka daek dae amih ah aka tanglue Diotrephi loh mamih n'doe moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te dongah, ka pawk atah, anih kah a saii khoboe te ka thoelh ni. Mamih te rhaithae olka m'pup thil. He nen khaw a rhaemhal kolla manuca rhoek te a doe moenih. Te phoeiah doe ham aka cai rhoek te a paa sak dongah hlangboel lamkah a thaek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thintlo rhoek , a thae te awt boel lamtah a then te awtuh. Aka then tah Pathen kah la om. Aka thae loh Pathen te a hmuh moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Demetrius te a cungkuem neh oltak amah lamloh a phong coeng. Te dongah mamih khaw m'phong uh. Te vaengah mamih kah laipainah tah oltak ni tila na ming uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang taengah daek ham muep ka khueh dae nang ham cahang neh cacung neh daek ham ka ngaih moenih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tedae nangmih te tlek hmuh ham ka ngaiuep. Te vaengah ka neh ka rhoi te n'thui bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang taengah ngaimongnah om seh. Paya rhoek loh nang toidal uh. Paya rhoek te a ming neh toidal lah.
  </para>
</usx>
